      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "This seemed like a good company to use, so called 'family operated' and local.  Also we had a family member use them so felt happy about our decision.  They came out to do a quote and assured us they would install 16 panels.  We agreed and I was trusting enough to paid upfront.  On the day of installation they left a mess (screws etc dropped on ground and in garden), also the tradesmen were driving off before one advised 'We only installed 15 panels, couldn't fit the last one' (they had already previously advised the layout would be fine for 16 panels on two areas of the roof).  After questioning this I was offered approximately $50 back for the panel that wasn't fitted.  I asked if we could have the last panel placed on roof, person in office said she would speak to the installers about getting them back to do this.  NO RESPONSE from our phone calls and emails.Also, their promise of a 'referral payment' never eventuated.Really unbelievable!  Do not recommend DMC Electrical and Energy at all!",
