      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We were heavily spammed by pushy salespeople from other companies. SO happy we made the decision to go with DMC because our friends are having a nightmare experience with one of the same big fancy solar companies selling cheap solar. 50% deposit paid and they aren't even installed yet and it's been 3 months. and now they're not replying to their emails. Nightmare. DMC was great to deal with. fast, professional & trustworthy. Megan was really helpful at explaining everything. The boys did an excellent job on the day. And the after-sales service by Megan has been outstanding. Nothing was too hard and she has kept us informed the whole way through. Thanks guys. happy we finally got solar done right. Jacinta and Troy, GC",
